// DESIGN.md § Decisions, D-Infer.  A type argument in EXPRESSION position.
// Measured 9f5cf6a96: `comparison operators do not chain` — it is read as `first < integer > (a)`.
// Expected: still refused, in words that name the cure (annotate the binding).
fn first<T>(v: vector<T>) -> T { return v[0]; }
fn main() {
  a: vector<integer> = [1, 2];
  print("{first<integer>(a)}");
}
